{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":12},"À cause des filles.. ? (For the Ones We Loved)","À l’occasion d’une noce d’où le mari s’est enfui, à peine la cérémonie terminée, chacun, en guise d’épithalame – ce chant composé à l’occasion d’un mariage –, va s’employer à remonter le moral de la mariée. Tous ont leur mot à dire sur l’inconstance, les surprises de la vie conjugale, les péripéties inattendues et les amours malheureuses. (At a wedding where the husband runs away, everyone has his own story to tell about the trivial misfortune of a person in love with someone that slips away. The guests paint a full picture of clumsiness, lies, and bad luck, that makes impossible, whatever the age, all attempts of seduction... or close enough!)",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11],"wedding","parenthood","extended family","personal memory","artistic creation","romance","widowhood","loneliness",{"type":13,"id":14,"slug":15,"title":16,"release":19,"filmType":23,"directors":24,"genre":33,"media":36,"synopsis":39,"production":42,"characters":45,"roles":46,"awards":120,"tags":3},"Film","FR2019_022","fr2019-022-a-cause-des-filles",{"native":17,"english":18},"À cause des filles.. ?","For the Ones We Loved",{"type":20,"date":21,"year":22},"Theatrical release","2019-01-30",2019,"Fiction film",[25],{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":28,"deathYear":29,"gender":30,"nationality":31,"awards":32},"Pascal Thomas","pascal-thomas",1945,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[34,35],"Comedy","Multi-protagonist film",{"posterUrl":37,"trailerUrl":38},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/247/16/200951/format_page/a-cause-des-filles.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qSsufylAIsU",{"native":40,"english":41},"À l’occasion d’une noce d’où le mari s’est enfui, à peine la cérémonie terminée, chacun, en guise d’épithalame – ce chant composé à l’occasion d’un mariage –, va s’employer à remonter le moral de la mariée. Tous ont leur mot à dire sur l’inconstance, les su